{
  "name": "Duel",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You may use this skill if your subclass is Champion, Gladiator, or Duelist.</p>\n<p>Give the target a [Duel] tag. If a person with a [Duel] tag is included in the target of your attack, +5 to the damage roll. This effect lasts at the end of the scene or until you are in a [Hidden] state.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(CR 11): &nbsp;Increase the damage by +5.<br>(CR 21): &nbsp;Increase the damage by an additional +5.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A skill that challenges a determined opponent to a duel. A spectacular battle where you collide head-on with power is your monopoly.</p>",
